			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 190030601,
					"content": "Yes, my child?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030602,
					"content": "About Barbara's time off...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 190030603,
					"content": "Oh yes, Sister Barbara just submitted her request for half a day's leave. She said she had plans with a friend.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030604,
					"content": "I must say though, it is quite unusual for Barbara to request time off just to see a friend...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030605,
					"content": "But that's beside the point. What is it you'd like to ask me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030606,
					"content": "About \"Fantastic Summer-Serendipity Coral Sparkling Tea\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 190030607,
					"content": "Oh? You mean to tell me that Barbara intends to accompany you to buy this... special drink?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030608,
					"content": "Then you must be the friend that she mentioned, I presume?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030609,
					"content": "Hmm, seeing as you're the Honorary Knight, I guess that's fine...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030610,
					"content": "Well then, please take good care of Sister Barbara.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030611,
					"content": "Why does Barbara always have to report her plans?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030612
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 190030612,
					"content": "Well, as you may already know, Sister Barbara is quite popular in Mondstadt for several reasons...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030613,
					"content": "Although the citizens here may only be acting out of good intention, there are too many of them, and Sister Barbara can't handle it all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030614,
					"content": "If they appear while she is working here at the Church, we can come and intervene.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030615,
					"content": "But if she's approached by fans during her time off, then she can only fend for herself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030616,
					"content": "And not to mention, she's too... kind. She'll always try to fulfill the requests of the citizens of Mondstadt, even when it takes a heavy toll and leaves her more exhausted than actual working hours.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030617,
					"content": "So with that in mind, we thought we'd have Sister Barbara always tell us where she'd be, just in case we need to come rescue her from the crowds.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						190030618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				},
				{
					"id": 190030618,
					"content": "My hope is that Sister Barbara stops pushing herself so hard...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						0
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Victoria"
				}
			]
		},
